<p>Dropwizard Metrics supports <a href=http://metrics.dropwizard.io/3.2.3/getting-started.html target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">several reporting backends</a>:
console, JMX, HTTP, Graphite, Ganglia, etc.</p>
<p>You would typically pass in an instance of <code>MetricsRegistry</code>
to the <code>StandardMetricsCollector</code>. Here is an example
with JMX:</p>
