<p>In production, make sure to use HTTPS for the token endpoint URI and configure
the <code>SSLContext</code> if necessary for the HTTPS requests (to verify and trust
the identity of the OAuth 2 server). The following snippet does
so by using the <code>tls().sslContext()</code> method from
<code>OAuth2ClientCredentialsGrantCredentialsProviderBuilder</code>:</p>
